    "post_rendered": "For any <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62b2b7ae1c0b0c5c222bc6fd33a77175584e30a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n,T \\geq 2, n, T \\in \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" >,</span> find all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2a74338dcca72fb1317929a3f768d8ebf682feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" > such that <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a72dedae3987992a10b374e4a7a8c75b365e209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall a_i &gt; 0, i = 1, 2, \\ldots, n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" >,</span> we have<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a958abd854ce74fc65e4fcee767f70887db1915.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum^n_{k=1} \\frac{a \\cdot k + \\frac{a^2}{4}}{S_k} &lt; T^2 \\cdot \\sum^n_{k=1} \\frac{1}{a_k},\\]\"  width=\"217\" height=\"52\" > where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd4cd19f0a3870f77fd5e82f6ba9d8bd075ab7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_k = \\sum^k_{i=1} a_i.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"91\" height=\"51\" >",
    "post_canonical": "For any $n,T \\geq 2, n, T \\in \\mathbb{N}$, find all $a \\in \\mathbb{N}$ such that $\\forall a_i > 0, i = 1, 2, \\ldots, n$, we have\r\n\r\n\\[\\sum^n_{k=1} \\frac{a \\cdot k + \\frac{a^2}{4}}{S_k} < T^2 \\cdot \\sum^n_{k=1} \\frac{1}{a_k},\\] where $S_k = \\sum^k_{i=1} a_i.$",
